{"id":"re_glement","lemma":"règlement","pos":"noun","rank":2573,"glosses":["rules, regulations","payment"],"ipa":"/ʁɛ.ɡlə.mɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c8/Fr-r%C3%A8glement.ogg/Fr-r%C3%A8glement.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"règlements"},"formAudio":{"règlements":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ac/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-r%C3%A8glements.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Nous avons obéi au règlement.","en":"We obeyed the rules.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/67141","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to obey","l":"obéir"},{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"Nous devons toujours obéir aux règlements.","en":"We always have to obey the rules.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"must","l":"devoir"},{"g":"always"},{"g":"to obey"},{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"Nous devrions en finir avec ce règlement.","en":"We should do away with this regulation.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"must","l":"devoir"},null,null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"this / it"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"to put an end to…"]]},{"text":"Ne me faites pas changer ce règlement !","en":"Don't make me change that policy.","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to exchange"},{"g":"this / it"},null]},{"text":"Veuillez obéir au règlement de l'école.","en":"Please obey the school rules.","words":[{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"to obey"},{"g":"to the"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"school"}]}]}